Text:
The Reconciliator makes the desk start one program when a person opens a file with one of some extensions.
A 'program' is named by the TaggedText that encodes the path of that program.
os.holders is a Holders: (OSExtension->TaggedText) is in os.holders exactly while the desk starts the program TaggedText when a person opens a file with the extension OSExtension, for example with a double click.
os.holders holds every program of the desk that the desk starts in that way.
The desk, a person and every program can change os.holders at any moment.
A program is 'named fearlessOnClick' when the last segment of the path of that program is "fearlessOnClick", or "fearlessOnClick" followed by the extension that the desk gives to programs.
//later: how the person is asked to let a program open the files of an extension, and which program shows that question
//later: what the Reconciliator writes on each desk, and how the Reconciliator reads os.holders on each desk
//later: the icons that the desk shows for the files of an extension and for the windows of a program
//later: two calls of reconciliator$reconcile never run at the same time on one desk

Grammar:
OSExtensions ::= OSExtension1 .. OSExtensionn
Holders ::= Holder1 .. Holdern
Holder ::= (OSExtension->TaggedText)

Well formedness:
in OSExtensions: if OSExtensions is OSExtension1 .. OSExtensionn, then OSExtension1 .. OSExtensionn are disjoint
in Holders: if Holders is (OSExtension1->_) .. (OSExtensionn->_), then OSExtension1 .. OSExtensionn are disjoint

Signature: reconciliator$personAllows(OSExtension,TaggedText)//holds when the person, asked, lets the program that reconciles open the files with the extension OSExtension in place of the program TaggedText

Signature: reconciliator$allowed(OSExtensions) = OSExtensions'//the extensions of OSExtensions that the program that reconciles can take

Define OSExtension in reconciliator$allowed(OSExtensions):
A fact OSExtension in OSExtensions
B fact (OSExtension->_) not in os.holders

Define OSExtension in reconciliator$allowed(OSExtensions):
A fact OSExtension in OSExtensions
B fact (OSExtension->TaggedText) in os.holders
C fact TaggedText is named fearlessOnClick.

Define OSExtension in reconciliator$allowed(OSExtensions):
A fact OSExtension in OSExtensions
B fact (OSExtension->TaggedText) in os.holders
C fact TaggedText is not named fearlessOnClick.
D fact OSExtension is not of form FearlessExtension.
E fact reconciliator$personAllows(OSExtension,TaggedText)

Define OSExtension in reconciliator$allowed(OSExtensions):
A fact OSExtension in OSExtensions
B fact OSExtension is of form FearlessExtension.

Define reconciliator$reconcile(TaggedText,OSExtensions):
A fact reconciliator$allowed(OSExtensions) = OSExtension1 .. OSExtensionn
B action the desk is changed so that (OSExtension1->TaggedText) .. (OSExtensionn->TaggedText) are in os.holders; the Holder of every other OSExtension stays as it is
C if OSExtensioni is of form FearlessExtension and (OSExtensioni->TaggedText) is not in os.holders after line B was done 3 times, error reconciliatorErrorFearlessExtensionIsNotHeld(OSExtensioni)
